<title>RUSSIA: Russian October yr/yr inflation 27.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Russian October yr/yr inflation 27.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's year-on-year consumer price inflation slowed in October to 27.2 percent from 31.7 percent in September, the State Statistics Committee said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN CONSUMER PRICES    OCT 96    SEP 96    OCT 95</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change	 +1.2	+0.3	+4.7</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change	  +27.2     +31.7    +186.2</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
